      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/analytical-hillshading, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"For each cell, the angle at which light coming from the position of the light source hits the terrain surface (SAGA's standard method).\"",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
