      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Decision D4: tool keywords removed: ta_lighting; 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/elevation: GeoTIFF; outputs/result: GeoTIFF); sources removed (tools, testbed, the bbox schema now in the representation's format): SAGA 7.3.0 -- Analytical Hillshading <https://saga-gis.sourceforge.io/saga_tool_doc/7.3.0/ta_lighting_0.html>; ZOO-Project Geonovum testbed -- SAGA.ta_lighting.0: Analytical Hillshading <https://host1.tb.geonovum.geolabs.fr/ogc-api/processes/SAGA.ta_lighting.0>; description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles.",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/analytical-hillshading"
    },
    {
